{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"USN-8979-2","published":"2026-11-17T00:51:34Z","modified":"2026-11-18T00:58:39.544842158Z","related":["UBUNTU-CVE-2017-7178","UBUNTU-CVE-2017-9031"],"upstream":["CVE-2017-7178","CVE-2017-9031","UBUNTU-CVE-2017-7178","UBUNTU-CVE-2017-9031"],"summary":"deluge vulnerabilities","details":"USN-8979-1 fixed vulnerabilities in Deluge. Due to a packaging error, the\nfixes were not applied in the update for Ubuntu 16.04 LTS. This update\nfixes the problem.\n\nOriginal advisory details:\n\n It was discovered that the web UI in Deluge did not protect against\n cross-site request forgery. A remote attacker could possibly use this\n issue to trick a user into installing a malicious plugin, resulting in the\n execution of arbitrary code. (CVE-2017-7178)\n\n It was discovered that the web UI in Deluge incorrectly handled certain\n requests. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to read\n arbitrary files. (CVE-2017-9031)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"deluge","ecosystem":"Ubuntu:Pro:16.04:LTS","purl":"pkg:deb/ubuntu/deluge?arch=source&distro=esm-apps-legacy%2Fxenial"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"}]}],"versions":["1.3.12-1ubuntu1","1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm1"],"ecosystem_specific":{"availability":"Available with Ubuntu Pro with Legacy support add-on: https://ubuntu.com/pro","binaries":[{"binary_name":"deluge","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"},{"binary_name":"deluge-common","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"},{"binary_name":"deluge-console","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"},{"binary_name":"deluge-gtk","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"},{"binary_name":"deluge-torrent","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"},{"binary_name":"deluge-web","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"},{"binary_name":"deluge-webui","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"},{"binary_name":"deluged","binary_version":"1.3.12-1ubuntu1+esm2"}]},"database_specific":{"cves_map":{"cves":[{"id":"CV